<title>USA: PaineWebber restructures R.I. Housing Corp bonds.</title>
<headline>PaineWebber restructures R.I. Housing Corp bonds.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>PaineWebber Inc said Wednesday it restructured Rhode Island Housing and Mortgage Finance Corp's $20 million bond deal.</p>
<p>The restructuring follows:</p>
<p>RHODE ISLAND HOUSING AND MORTGAGE FINANCE CORP.</p>
<p>RE: $20,000,000*</p>
<p>HOMEOWNERSHIP OPPORTUNITY BONDS,</p>
<p>SERIES 19-C (NON-AMT)</p>
<p>SERIES 19-D (AMT)</p>
<p>(REMARKETING)</p>
<p>NOTE RESTRUCTURING.</p>
<p>VERBAL AWARD.</p>
